DESCRIPTION:Topic\n:\nFinding RED through Effective Empathy\nSynopsis\n:\nH
	ow to better understand what our customers want\, think and need through p
	erspective-taking.  \nA practical and applied approach on how to conscious
	ly apply empathy to create better interactions and outcomes within the RED
	 framework.\nSpeaker\n:\nMark Englehart EVANS\nJoining Instructions\n(via 
	Webex)\n \nJoin via Laptop\n*As a first time participant using DBS laptop\
	, you must follow this  One Time Webex Setup using DBS Laptop.mp4 <https:/
	/dbs1bank-my.sharepoint.com/:v:/g/personal/jamesongck_dbs_com/EVcKkn_W6DlC
	q6ZBNJZMd10Bd_0ordpIVCHSxT1Ucjyl6g?e=SzBDh2>  guide prior to the event. Th
	is will install Webex Meeting App from DBS Software Centre for optimal str
	eaming experience!\n1.	On the day of the event\, click on this hyperlink: 
	Webex Events URL <https://dbs.webex.com/dbs/onstage/g.php?MTID=e7716564ccf
	e56b67dbb7054a6f359fb0> \n2.	Enter your First Name\, Last Name\, Email Add
	ress and click on [Join Now]\n \n \nJoin via Mobile Device\n1.	Download We
	bex Meetings App from Apple App Store or Google PlayStore\nClick on Join M
	eeting & Input Meeting Number: 2510 686 5933\n2.	Input Password 1234\n \n 
	\nJoin via Phone (audio only)\nDial:  +65-3157-6442 (Singapore)\nDial:  +8
	52-3018-6828 (Hong Kong)\nDial:  +91-22-6480-0114 (India-Mumbai)\nDial:  +
	91-40-6480-0114 (India-Hyderabad)\nMeeting Number:  2510 686 5933\nGlobal 
	call-in numbers <https://dbs.webex.com/dbs/globalcallin.php?MTID=e8b348588
	cbf111d8933d1b2e9c4a554e> \n \n \n \n \n \n
